  "description": "Blackthorn 125 C GX Transmission is a carbon trail bike that brings versatility to every stretch of singletrack. The carbon fiber frame is lightweight but not light on features: cargo mounts on the frame allow for two bottles and other accessories so you can ride longer without resupply.\n\nIts 125mm of Split Pivot suspension travel delivers active traction whether you’re pedaling up a techy climb or riding the brakes down a sketchy descent; a RockShox Pike Select+ fork with 140mm travel adds cushion and control. Blackthorn’s balanced geometry puts you in position to thrive on the ups and downs of all-day riding.\n\nSRAM’s GX Transmission group offers smooth, swift, and precise electronic shifts so you’re always in the right gear for what’s ahead.",
